  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cadec Harare- LPPZ- Fertiliser Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at complimenting the Emergency Food Security programme in two wards of Svosve communal areas, Marondera District in Mashonaland East Province of Zimbabwe (Archdiocese of Harare). The EFSP has been providing food support to the beneficiaries in these selected wards of the district and this project will ensure that the households that received food will be able to produce enough food to feed themselves in 2009/10. Soil fertility being the most limiting factor to crop production besides water, it is important that fertiliser be distributed to the food beneficiaries so that they can improve food production at household level for the coming year.</narrative>
  </description>
